        'en' => ['title' => 'Leaving Germany for good', 'lead' => 'You are leaving Germany permanently and giving up your home. We prepare the deregistration of your contribution account and submit it to Beitragsservice. Beitragsservice decides from when no further payments are due. We can do it all in English.',
